# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only what the build needs.
# Re-includes are listed per directory: buildah/podman does not honour a
# `!**/*.go` re-include beneath a `**` exclusion the way Docker does.
**

# Go module files and source directories
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!api
!internal
!pkg

# Tests are never part of the image
**/*_test.go
